            "description": "Status Quo (2020) and projection (2020) of P2H capacities in Germany on NUTS3-level. 2030 data based on freely available data                     (e.g. operator homepages, manufacturer information, industry presentations). 2030 projections via linear interpolation of                     scenario B in NEP37/45. Regionalization of the expansion is based on current industrial CHP locations (MaSTR, Kraftwerksliste)                     for electrode boilers (cap_ind) and on district heating potential (heat demand densities from hotmaps, restrictions from Jochum et al.                     (2017): Ableitung eines Korridors für den Ausbauder erneuerbaren Wärme im Gebäudebereich) for large heat pumps (cap_pub)",
